  "bio": "Justin Klein, based in Coram, United States, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in lettering. His work is a testament to his expertise as a visual artist, illustrator, muralist, and tattooist, which can be appreciated both online at www.justinklein.art and in-person at @saigon.tattoo. Whether you're looking to ink a poignant phrase or a statement piece in beautiful typography, Justin is known for his precise and artful execution of lettering tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Coram, New York, United States"
